{"id":51501,"date":"2026-05-30T00:14:56","date_gmt":"2026-05-29T23:14:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51501"},"modified":"2026-09-27T23:54:57","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T22:54:57","slug":"corrida-volkswagen-autoeuropa","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-volkswagen-autoeuropa\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Volkswagen Autoeuropa 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Volkswagen Autoeuropa 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida Volkswagen Autoeuropa 2026<\/strong> (tamb\u00e9m designada como <strong>Volkswagen Run<\/strong>) realiza-se no dia <strong>25 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), em <strong>Palmela<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>. A competi\u00e7\u00e3o abre as portas de uma das maiores f\u00e1bricas de autom\u00f3veis da Europa a milhares de corredores e fam\u00edlias, oferecendo uma experi\u00eancia desportiva e tecnol\u00f3gica \u00fanica com partidas e chegadas nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es centrais da <strong>Volkswagen Autoeuropa<\/strong> na Quinta da Marquesa.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Podes optar pela <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> cronometrada por chip eletr\u00f3nico no interior da f\u00e1brica e parque industrial adjacente (partida \u00e0s 10:00), pela <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> para todas as idades (partida \u00e0s 10:20) ou pelas corridas infantis da <strong>Mini Kids<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 09:00 com dist\u00e2ncias dos 300m aos 1000m para Bambis, Benjamins e Infantis). O evento inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial unissexo, dorsal personalizado, medalha de finalista, abastecimentos e estacionamento gratuito no complexo industrial.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o pertence \u00e0 <strong>Volkswagen Autoeuropa<\/strong> com a coordena\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica e operacional da <strong>HMS Sports<\/strong>, garantindo percursos planos em asfalto com seguran\u00e7a integral e cronometragem oficial via Lap2Go.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; p