; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 de Outubro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 31 de Julho:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (31\/07\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">A partir de 1 de Agosto:<\/strong> 16.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (25\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 5 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 de Outubro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:20<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 31 de Julho:<\/strong> 11.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (31\/07\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">A partir de 1 de Agosto:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (25\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Mini (Kids)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 de Outubro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o \u00danico:<\/strong> 7.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (25\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida Volkswagen Autoeuropa 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es centrais da Volkswagen Autoeuropa (Quinta da Marquesa, Quinta do Anjo), em Palmela, distrito de Set\u00fabal.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida e dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Mini Kids arranca \u00e0s 09:00 (dist\u00e2ncias de 300m a 1000m por escal\u00e3o), a Corrida principal de 10 km parte \u00e0s 10:00 (percurso dentro da f\u00e1brica e parque industrial adjacente) e a Caminhada de 5 km tem in\u00edcio \u00e0s 10:20.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando podem ser levantados os kits de atleta e dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A entrega dos kits decorre a 22 de outubro (11:00 \u00e0s 17:00) na Sala Volkswagen da f\u00e1brica Autoeuropa (edif\u00edcio 11, Palmela) e nos dias 23 (12:00 \u00e0s 18:00) e 24 de outubro (10:00 \u00e0s 18:00) na Nike Store do Centro Colombo, em Lisboa. Aten\u00e7\u00e3o que n\u00e3o ser\u00e3o entregues kits no dia da prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o estacionamento no dia do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O estacionamento no dia da corrida pode ser realizado gratuitamente no interior das instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Volkswagen Autoeuropa, em \u00e1reas devidamente identificadas pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o para acolher os atletas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os tempos limite e postos de abastecimento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite de prova \u00e9 de 2 horas para os 10 km e de 1h30 para a caminhada de 5 km, terminando o evento \u00e0s 12:00. Na prova de 10 km h\u00e1 abastecimentos aos km 4,1, km 7,5 e na meta; na caminhada h\u00e1 abastecimento ao km 2,8 e na meta; e na Mini h\u00e1 abastecimento na meta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida Volkswagen Autoeuropa 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-25\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Volkswagen Autoeuropa, Palmela\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Palmela\", \"addressRegion\": \"Set\u00fabal\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"HMS Sports\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida Volkswagen Autoeuropa 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es centrais da Volkswagen Autoeuropa (Quinta da Marquesa, Quinta do Anjo), em Palmela, distrito de Set\u00fabal.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida e dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Mini Kids arranca \u00e0s 09:00 (dist\u00e2ncias de 300m a 1000m por escal\u00e3o), a Corrida principal de 10 km parte \u00e0s 10:00 (percurso dentro da f\u00e1brica e parque industrial adjacente) e a Caminhada de 5 km tem in\u00edcio \u00e0s 10:20.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando podem ser levantados os kits de atleta e dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A entrega dos kits decorre a 22 de outubro (11:00 \u00e0s 17:00) na Sala Volkswagen da f\u00e1brica Autoeuropa (edif\u00edcio 11, Palmela) e nos dias 23 (12:00 \u00e0s 18:00) e 24 de outubro (10:00 \u00e0s 18:00) na Nike Store do Centro Colombo, em Lisboa. Aten\u00e7\u00e3o que n\u00e3o ser\u00e3o entregues kits no dia da prova.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o estacionamento no dia do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O estacionamento no dia da corrida pode ser realizado gratuitamente no interior das instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Volkswagen Autoeuropa, em \u00e1reas devidamente identificadas pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o para acolher os atletas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os tempos limite e postos de abastecimento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite de prova \u00e9 de 2 horas para os 10 km e de 1h30 para a caminhada de 5 km, terminando o evento \u00e0s 12:00. Na prova de 10 km h\u00e1 abastecimentos aos km 4,1, km 7,5 e na meta; na caminhada h\u00e1 abastecimento ao km 2,8 e na meta; e na Mini h\u00e1 abastecimento na meta.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66832,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[28,672,27,624],"event_type_2":[48,728,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51501","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-palmela-setubal","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-kids","event_type_2-setubal","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/0